          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Rihkhuangc 2^< hiw tho, zauczihmei guang the!",
            "Kaipouc khang chuanghphey zay kauh tho!",
            "Nang ricpwan piu tho, meic guay chamdaanv tho,",
            "Kalat ’thanmei khou nang ngangvlou tho.",
            "",
            "Thau tho, rihmei!",
            "Chuanghphey bangc khou guang tho!",
            "Chamdaanv tho, nang dyng kalyng chuy tho;",
            "Hu thangc gut tho! Hosanna kauc ranvna;",
            "Rih kangdai rihpi kiu Khrista e!",
            "",
            "2 Zauczihmei ta ngam khang baucna gut kho,",
            "Thay e, aniu ngam puni de;",
            "N-gih lev chuanghphey sinna ‘dow bam khou",
            "Aniu zawsiimei nai zat lak ge!",
            "",
            "3 He meic guay Racguangc,huaymei chulou o;",
            "Nang zauzian paan !}2 ’khavlou o;",
            "Rih hei luai lana rih ngam guang pwkhou",
            "Nang hu khou ’niw swan pyrun run ni!"
          ]
